OL,3,GNEWSALove of black cabs behind
OL,4,Adeveloper's booking plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Coventry man says it was his love of
OL,7,Fblack cabs that drove him to help
OL,8,Fstruggling taxi drivers in the city by
OL,9,Fdeveloping a new app to allow their
OL,10,Fcustomers to book with them directly.
OL,12,FMax Parsons, from Hillfields, developed
OL,13,Fhis Artificial Intelligence direct
OL,14,Fbooking tool, which uses WhatsApp,
OL,15,Fspecifically for black cabs.
OL,17,FDrivers of the vehicles told the BBC
OL,18,Ftheir usual level of trade in the city
OL,19,Fhas dropped over the years due to an
OL,20,Fincrease in the cost of living and
OL,21,Fcompetition from ride hailing apps.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
