OL,3,GNEWSALove of black cabs behind
OL,4,Adeveloper's booking plan
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've been a fan of black cabs for
OL,7,Fquite a long time and I realised how
OL,8,Fmuch in decline they were so," Parsons
OL,9,Fsaid, about what drove his idea.
